\description{
Loads the \code{nba_stats_synergy} release: 72 files per season,
one per season type, play type, offensive/defensive split and per mode
(\verb{\{season_type\}_\{play_type\}_\{type_grouping\}_\{per_mode\}_\{END year\}.parquet}).
The requested combinations (all of them by default) are bound into one
frame, one row per player per play type per split. \code{season_type} and
\code{per_mode} are added from the file name when a file's rows lack them.
Reading both per modes widens the counting columns (\code{poss}, \code{pts}, \code{fgm},
\code{fga}, \code{fgmx}), which are integer in \code{totals} files and decimal in
\code{pergame} files, to double.
}
